// This file emulates the linker and creates the section as globals
// that are usually generated by a linker as defined in the linker script.
// Linker script section variables will be emited to LLVM-IR by this file.
// This code is specific to Zephyr-RTOS.
// This file emulates linker scripts found in the files:
// - include/zephyr/linker/common-rom/common-rom-kernel-devices.ld
// - include/zephyr/arch/posix/native_tasks.ld
// - include/zephyr/sys/interate_sections.h
// - scripts/native_simulator/common/other/linker_script.pre.ld
// - etc.

